2. Adapted

text2bpmn/cases/goods_dispatch/input.txt
    The exercise text of 1, reworded; the pipeline's input for the case study.
    It differs from the exercise text in these places:
    - "In the meantime the goods can be already packaged by the warehousemen."
      is moved to second place and begins "In parallel,";
    - "Therefore a package label is written by the secretary and a parcel
      insurance taken by ..." reads "In the same time, a package label is
      written by the secretary, and a parcel insurance is taken by ...";
    - "If everything is ready," reads "If everything is ready and merged,";
    - the "Background" paragraph is left out, and so are the headings
      ("exercise 1", "Dispatch of Goods", "Please model the following
      process").


3. Derived from 1 and 2

- the pipeline's outputs on the text of 2, which repeat parts of it: the
