To check the copy

    git clone https://github.com/camunda/bpmn-for-research
    git -C bpmn-for-research checkout 1416f6f2104ae597eafa3097946140ebc2136a53
    sha256sum "bpmn-for-research/BPMN for Research/English/01-Dispatch-of-goods/03-Solution/Dispatch-of-goods.bpmn" \
              text2bpmn/cases/goods_dispatch/reference.bpmn

text2bpmn/tests/test_third_party.py checks the second checksum.
